  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A hair and body mist that contains notes of pistachio milk and raspberry sugar.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Warm & Spicy</p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm & Sweet Gourmands</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes: </strong>Pistachio Milk, Creamy Woods, Raspberry Sugar<strong><br><br>About the Fragrance: </strong>Sweet, warm, dreamy. Mist on the go, from morning to night—wherever the day takes you. This effortlessly indulgent, long-lasting body fragrance mist will remind you of your favorite vanilla treat with every spray.<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, phthalates, and sulfates SLS & SLES. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Mist all over your body as needed throughout the day. <br>-Wear each scent on its own, or pair the balm and mist together in Vanilla (sold separately), Pink Guava (sold separately), or Pistachio Milk for a layered fragrance.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol Denat., Water/Aqua/Eau, Fragrance/Parfum, Vanillin, Rose Ketones, Eugenol, Hexyl Cinnamal, Benzaldehyde, Benzyl Benzoate.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A hair and body mist that contains notes of pistachio milk and raspberry sugar.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Warm & Spicy</p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm & Sweet Gourmands</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes: </strong>Pistachio Milk, Creamy Woods, Raspberry Sugar<strong><br><br>About the Fragrance: </strong>Sweet, warm, dreamy. Mist on the go, from morning to night—wherever the day takes you. This effortlessly indulgent, long-lasting body fragrance mist will remind you of your favorite vanilla treat with every spray.<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, phthalates, and sulfates SLS & SLES. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Mist all over your body as needed throughout the day. <br>-Wear each scent on its own, or pair the balm and mist together in Vanilla (sold separately), Pink Guava (sold separately), or Pistachio Milk for a layered fragrance.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol Denat., Water/Aqua/Eau, Fragrance/Parfum, Vanillin, Rose Ketones, Eugenol, Hexyl Cinnamal, Benzaldehyde, Benzyl Benzoate.</div></details>",
